# Pinned publisher key for Ground State web publications.
#
# Format: OpenSSH allowed_signers, see ssh-keygen(1). One current line:
#   ground-state-web-publisher namespaces="ground-state.web-publication.v1" ssh-ed25519 AAAA… <comment>
#
# Rotation (SECURITY.md): add valid-before="YYYYMMDDZ" to the old line, add the
# new key with valid-after="YYYYMMDDZ" (same instant, UTC, with the Z). Published
# bundles keep verifying at their own authorized_at; a new bundle must be signed
# by a key valid now. Compromise: delete the line instead. Only namespaces,
# valid-after and valid-before are understood; a line with any other option is
# ignored, so its key is not trusted.
